WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
[Instrumental music]
TeXCodes: Aap ki tech shop ka system. Stock aur warranty ke saath.
Computer, laptop, console.

00:04.500 --> 00:12.000
PC aur gaming shops: parts jo compatible hon.
CPU socket check, DDR4 / DDR5 match, power supply estimate. Real product screen, sample catalogue.

00:12.000 --> 00:19.500
Apna stock, har waqt. Counter, online orders aur har branch, ek hi stock se.
Real product administration, demo data.

00:19.500 --> 00:25.500
Har serial number ka record: stock intake aur supplier, sale aur invoice, warranty claim aur replacement record.

00:25.500 --> 00:34.500
Pehle demo. Phir aap ki shop ke hisaab se scope.
Demo call, written proposal, phir private link pe test aur launch.
Har kharcha proposal mein likha hota hai, shuru se pehle.

00:34.500 --> 00:42.000
Aap ki shop ke liye bana. Launch ke baad aap ka.
Apni shop ka demo book karein: 0309 1824000.
